==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===

* [[liggje#Norwegian Nynorsk|liggje]] (e infinitive)
* {{nn-inf|ligg|e=1|br=1}} 

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|liggja|lang=non}}.

===Verb===
{{nn-verb|ligg|br-pre=ligger|låg|lege|legi}}

# to [[lie]] (to be in a horizontal position.)
#: ''Kvifor '''ligg''' du her?''
#:: Why are you '''lying''' here?
# to [[lie]] (location), to be [[located]]
#: ''Kvar '''ligg''' kjøpesenteret?''
#:: Where is the shopping centre '''located'''?

